cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "mouse_radar_pipeline: breathing, apnea and heart rate of freely behaving mice from mm-wave radar"
version: 1.7.0
date-released: "2026-11-10"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/bernie-samders/mouse-radar-hashed-pipeline"
authors:
  - family-names: "Ihns"
    given-names: "Sam"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0004-4830-2953"
abstract: >-
  Locked release (v1.7.0) of the radar analysis pipeline: two-template breath segmentation, Stettner breathing
  metrics, pause distribution, azimuth motion, apneas validated against whole-body plethysmography, and ECG-free heart
  rate and beat-to-beat heart rate validated against implanted ECG. Every file is listed with its SHA-256 in
  MANIFEST.sha256; run verify_lock.py to check a copy.
keywords:
  - radar
  - respiration
  - apnea
  - heart rate
  - mouse
  - Rett syndrome
